  "id": "USN-8895-1",
  "summary": "sudo vulnerability",
  "details": "It was discovered that Sudo did not properly handle time-based access\nrestrictions when sudoers rules used NOTBEFORE or NOTAFTER with\ntimestamps omitting the trailing timezone indicator. A local attacker\ncould possibly use this issue to execute commands outside the intended\ntime window by manipulating the TZ environment variable.",
